<view class="page"><view class="card"><view class="eyebrow">服务确认</view><text class="muted">确认服务完成后可提交评价。评价不会用于营销触达。</text><view class="field">短信验证码<view class="row"><input class="input" type="number" maxlength="6" bindinput="setCode" placeholder="6 位验证码" /><button class="code-button" size="mini" bindtap="sendCode" disabled="{{countdown > 0}}">{{countdown > 0 ? countdown + ' 秒后重试' : '获取验证码'}}</button></view></view><view class="field">服务评价<picker range="{{ratings}}" bindchange="pickRating"><view class="picker">{{selectedRating}}</view></picker></view><view class="field">补充说明（可选）<textarea class="textarea" bindinput="setComment" placeholder="可填写服务体验或待改进的问题" /></view><button class="primary" bindtap="submit">确认完成并提交评价</button></view></view>
